  "model_notes": [
    "Own functional implementation; physical channels and enable polarities follow the manufacturer datasheet.",
    "Fixed nominal delay, resistance, capacitance and quiescent current at room temperature; no full supply/load/temperature curves.",
    "AHCT input thresholds are absolute 0.8/2V. 244 input hysteresis is approximated by retention between these thresholds; 240/04 use ordinary conversion.",
    "No thermal, ESD, overvoltage, back-powering or current-limiting behavior; see docs/circuitalive/SMALL_LOGIC_MODELS.md."
